WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.514 --> 00:00:08.151
Welcome to Guildwise HQ. In under three minutes, you go from an empty organization to a team of AI agents at work.

2
00:00:08.856 --> 00:00:21.912
A new organization shows Get started in the sidebar. It lists what is left: a project, its repository, a workstation, your team, and a first talk with the business analyst. Each step ticks itself off.

3
00:00:22.614 --> 00:00:28.971
A workstation is the computer that runs your agents. Open Workstations, and choose Add a workstation.

4
00:00:29.671 --> 00:00:39.207
The guide asks where your agents run, gives you one command to copy, and shows the progress live. Here, Alex's laptop is already paired and online.

5
00:00:39.909 --> 00:00:47.440
Next, open Projects and choose New project. Give it a name and a short key. The key goes in front of every card number.

6
00:00:48.211 --> 00:00:52.328
Then, in the project settings, add the repository where the code lives.

7
00:00:53.030 --> 00:01:01.115
Now hire your team. On Agents, choose Hire agent, pick a role, and keep this project selected under Where may this agent work.

8
00:01:01.815 --> 00:01:09.218
A lean team has seven roles: a business analyst, a planner, an architect, a builder, a pre-reviewer, a reviewer and a tester.

9
00:01:11.769 --> 00:01:17.102
Together they plan, design, build and check every change before it reaches your main code.

10
00:01:21.953 --> 00:01:30.444
To ask for work, use New card at the top of the sidebar. Give it a title, say what you need and how you will know it is done, then choose Specify.

11
00:01:31.145 --> 00:01:36.926
You can also just talk to your business analyst. Open the chat, pick Bea, and ask in plain words.

12
00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:42.450
She answers like a colleague, and can turn the conversation into cards.

13
00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:49.914
When an agent needs a decision, it lands on the Desk, and the number in the sidebar tells you.

14
00:01:50.614 --> 00:01:54.795
Pick an option and choose Answer. The count drops, and the agent carries on.

15
00:01:55.497 --> 00:02:02.985
On the Board, the card moves from column to column by itself, as the agents plan, design, build, review and test.

16
00:02:06.688 --> 00:02:13.877
Help is at the bottom of the sidebar, with the articles, the glossary and the guided tour. And Ctrl K jumps anywhere.

17
00:02:14.596 --> 00:02:18.543
That is all it takes. Thank you for watching, and enjoy your new team.
